  ["Written scope", "Usually, after a discovery phase", "Often a short job post", "Always, before any payment is due"],
  ["SEO and schema", "Often a separate package", "Frequently skipped", "Titles, schema, sitemap and Search Console in every build"],
  ["After launch", "Paid retainer from day one", "Ends when the contract closes", "5 months of maintenance included"],
