  <!-- ===================== QUICK ANSWER + SNAPSHOT ===================== -->
  <section class="answer" aria-labelledby="answer-heading">
    <div class="section-wrap answer-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">The short answer</p>
        <h2 id="answer-heading">Looking for a web development company for your Australian business?</h2>
        <p id="quick-answer" class="answer-text">BtechWaleTech is a three-engineer team based in India that builds websites, ecommerce stores, SEO systems, custom software and AI automations for Australian businesses, working remotely during your afternoon. Websites start from {usd("Static")}, ecommerce from {usd("Ecommerce")} and custom web apps from {usd("Custom web app")}, in US dollars with AUD invoicing on request. Hosting and deployment are included, and the first five months of maintenance after launch are free.</p>
        <p class="answer-more">Australia is not one market. A tradie in Penrith, a winery in McLaren Vale and a mining services supplier in Perth need different things from a website, and they work in different time zones. This page explains what we build, how Australian payments, SEO and compliance fit in, what it costs, how the time difference works and how to hire an offshore developer safely.</p>
      </div>
      <table class="snapshot">
